{"articleNo":"544750","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_02.do?mode=view&articleNo=544750&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"[교외행사] 2025년 「지역일자리맵」활용 사례 수기 공모전","writer":"학생성공과","writeDate":"2025.11.20","hit":"3002","attachments":[],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-right: 5pt; word-break: keep-all;\"><br></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-right: 5pt; word-break: keep-all; text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/cms/plugin/editorImage.do?EwBmFYHoEZsgrAagOQEYHkBmBNAGgSwGUBhAYwC0AbcgOxoHsAJdAOgAcaBzIA%20\" class=\"txc-image\" style=\"clear:none;float:none;\"></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-right: 5pt; word-break: keep-all;\"><br></p><p class=\"0\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:굴림체;font-size:13.0pt;\"> </span><span style=\"font-family:굴림체;mso-fareast-font-family:굴림체;font-size:13.0pt;\">가</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:굴림체;font-family:굴림체;mso-ascii-font-family:굴림체;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:13.0pt;\">.</span><span style=\"font-family:굴림체;mso-fareast-font-family:굴림체;font-size:13.0pt;\">공모 개요</span></p><p class=\"0\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:굴림체;font-size:13.0pt;\">   </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:굴림체;font-family:굴림체;mso-ascii-font-family:굴림체;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:13.0pt;\">- </span><span style=\"font-family:굴림체;mso-fareast-font-family:굴림체;font-size:13.0pt;\">공 모 명 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:굴림체;font-family:굴림체;mso-ascii-font-family:굴림체;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:13.0pt;\">: 2025</span><span style=\"font-family:굴림체;mso-fareast-font-family:굴림체;font-size:13.0pt;\">년 </span><span style=\"font-family:굴림체;mso-fareast-font-family:굴림체;mso-hansi-font-family:굴림체;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:13.0pt;\">「</span><span style=\"font-family:굴림체;mso-fareast-font-family:굴림체;font-size:13.0pt;\">지역일자리맵</span><span style=\"font-family:굴림체;mso-fareast-font-family:굴림체;mso-hansi-font-family:굴림체;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:13.0pt;\">」</span><span style=\"font-family:굴림체;mso-fareast-font-family:굴림체;font-size:13.0pt;\">활용 사례 수기 공모전</span></p><p class=\"0\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:굴림체;font-size:13.0pt;\">   </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:굴림체;font-family:굴림체;mso-ascii-font-family:굴림체;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:13.0pt;\">- </span><span style=\"font-family:굴림체;mso-fareast-font-family:굴림체;font-size:13.0pt;\">공모기간 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:굴림체;font-family:굴림체;mso-ascii-font-family:굴림체;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:13.0pt;\">: ~ 2025.12.17</span></p><p class=\"0\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:굴림체;font-size:13.0pt;\">   </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:굴림체;font-family:굴림체;mso-ascii-font-family:굴림체;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:13.0pt;\">- </span><span style=\"font-family:굴림체;mso-fareast-font-family:굴림체;font-size:13.0pt;\">참가대상 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:굴림체;font-family:굴림체;mso-ascii-font-family:굴림체;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:13.0pt;\">: </span><span style=\"font-family:굴림체;mso-fareast-font-family:굴림체;font-size:13.0pt;\">지역일자리맵을 활용하는 일반 국민 누구나</span></p><p class=\"0\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:굴림체;font-size:13.0pt;\">   </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:굴림체;font-family:굴림체;mso-ascii-font-family:굴림체;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:13.0pt;\">- </span><span style=\"font-family:굴림체;mso-fareast-font-family:굴림체;font-size:13.0pt;\">문의 및 접수 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:굴림체;font-family:굴림체;mso-ascii-font-family:굴림체;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:13.0pt;\">: </span><span style=\"font-family:굴림체;mso-fareast-font-family:굴림체;font-size:13.0pt;\">지역일자리맵 대표 메일</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:굴림체;font-family:굴림체;mso-ascii-font-family:굴림체;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:13.0pt;\">(reimhelp@keis.or.kr)</span></p><p class=\"0\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:굴림체;font-size:13.0pt;\"> </span><span style=\"font-family:굴림체;mso-fareast-font-family:굴림체;font-size:13.0pt;\">나</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:굴림체;font-family:굴림체;mso-ascii-font-family:굴림체;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:13.0pt;\">. </span><span style=\"font-family:굴림체;mso-fareast-font-family:굴림체;font-size:13.0pt;\">공모주제 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:굴림체;font-family:굴림체;mso-ascii-font-family:굴림체;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:13.0pt;\">: </span><span style=\"font-family:굴림체;mso-fareast-font-family:굴림체;font-size:13.0pt;\">지역일자리맵의 다양한 데이터 기능 활용 사례</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-left: 87pt; text-indent: -87pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:굴림체;font-size:13.0pt;\"> </span><span style=\"font-family:굴림체;mso-fareast-font-family:굴림체;font-size:13.0pt;\">다</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:굴림체;font-family:굴림체;mso-ascii-font-family:굴림체;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:13.0pt;\">. </span><span style=\"font-family:굴림체;mso-fareast-font-family:굴림체;font-size:13.0pt;\">우수작 선정 및 시상계획 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:굴림체;font-family:굴림체;mso-ascii-font-family:굴림체;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:13.0pt;\">: </span><span style=\"font-family:굴림체;mso-fareast-font-family:굴림체;font-size:13.0pt;\">별도 심사위원 구성 및 평가를 통한 우수작 선정</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-left: 87pt; text-indent: -87pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:굴림체;font-size:13.0pt;\">   </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:굴림체;font-family:굴림체;mso-ascii-font-family:굴림체;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:13.0pt;\">- </span><span style=\"font-family:굴림체;mso-fareast-font-family:굴림체;font-size:13.0pt;\">최우수상 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:굴림체;font-family:굴림체;mso-ascii-font-family:굴림체;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:13.0pt;\">1</span><span style=\"font-family:굴림체;mso-fareast-font-family:굴림체;font-size:13.0pt;\">명</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:굴림체;font-family:굴림체;mso-ascii-font-family:굴림체;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:13.0pt;\">, </span><span style=\"font-family:굴림체;mso-fareast-font-family:굴림체;font-size:13.0pt;\">우수상 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:굴림체;font-family:굴림체;mso-ascii-font-family:굴림체;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:13.0pt;\">3</span><span style=\"font-family:굴림체;mso-fareast-font-family:굴림체;font-size:13.0pt;\">명</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:굴림체;font-family:굴림체;mso-ascii-font-family:굴림체;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:13.0pt;\">, </span><span style=\"font-family:굴림체;mso-fareast-font-family:굴림체;font-size:13.0pt;\">장려상 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:굴림체;font-family:굴림체;mso-ascii-font-family:굴림체;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:13.0pt;\">5</span><span style=\"font-family:굴림체;mso-fareast-font-family:굴림체;font-size:13.0pt;\">명</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:굴림체;font-family:굴림체;mso-ascii-font-family:굴림체;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:13.0pt;\">, </span><span style=\"font-family:굴림체;mso-fareast-font-family:굴림체;font-size:13.0pt;\">참가상 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:굴림체;font-family:굴림체;mso-ascii-font-family:굴림체;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:13.0pt;\">50</span><span style=\"font-family:굴림체;mso-fareast-font-family:굴림체;font-size:13.0pt;\">명</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:굴림체;font-family:굴림체;mso-ascii-font-family:굴림체;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:13.0pt;\">.</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-left: 14.8pt; text-indent: -14.8pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:굴림체;font-family:굴림체;mso-ascii-font-family:굴림체;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:13.0pt;\">*</span><span style=\"font-family:굴림체;mso-fareast-font-family:굴림체;font-size:13.0pt;\">자세한 사항은 지역일자리맵 사이트</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:굴림체;font-family:굴림체;mso-ascii-font-family:굴림체;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:13.0pt;\">(</span><u><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:굴림체;font-family:굴림체;mso-ascii-font-family:굴림체;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:13.0pt;\">https://epas.ilmoa.go.kr/reim/</span></u><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:굴림체;font-family:굴림체;mso-ascii-font-family:굴림체;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:13.0pt;\">)</span><span style=\"font-family:굴림체;mso-fareast-font-family:굴림체;font-size:13.0pt;\">의 공지사항을 확인부탁드립니다</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:굴림체;font-family:굴림체;mso-ascii-font-family:굴림체;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:13.0pt;\">.</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-left: 14.8pt; text-indent: -14.8pt;\">  <!--[if !supportEmptyParas]-